{"4760480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Are Empty: Absolute Edition", "steam_appid": 4760480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5080090], "detailed_description": "<h1>What's New in the Absolute Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Empty has been revitalized for modern systems, with fixes, new features, and QoL additions, including all the official localizations. Our team carefully went through the entire game whilst faithfully preserving the intent of the original <i>You Are Empty </i>release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/59811c5528a0a615129a4fef6961c291.webp?t=1787475783\" alt=\"UPGRADED JUST IN TIME FOR THE 20TH ANNIVERSARY\" width=1200 height=28 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >General Improvements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support for modern and legacy controllers with 3 presets to choose from, thanks to SDL</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed countless rendering bugs and crashes that were present in the original release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved loading times by ~800%</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engine Upgrades</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for all modern resolutions, and updated the game code to support every widescreen resolution</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game HUD, menus, weapons, and videos are no longer stretched, and adapt to any resolution</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable player FOV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional FPS limiter setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8x MSAA and 16x Anisotropic Filtering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consistent frametimes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed camera jittering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved Windowed mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rendering for Nvidia, AMD, and Intel GPU's are now on par with each other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Removed need for externally installed prerequisites and deprecated Windows APIs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quality of Life Options</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Togglable HUD via hotkey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically fade out the HUD when not shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduced camera bobbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprinting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This was added due to criticism of the original release's walk speed being too slow.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Are Empty was not originally designed with sprinting in mind. There might be some instances where pacing is off while this option is enabled.</i></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/a49dff358692a85bc17e9107faf6cff8.avif?t=1787475783\" alt=\"A forgotten cult classic shooter set in a Soviet totalitarian society.\" width=1200 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.poster.avif?t=1787475783\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.webm?t=1787475783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.mp4?t=1787475783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/d8238c6f15bc9ba60726f17933ca5226.avif?t=1787475783\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate history 1950s Soviet Kyiv, most of the city's population has mysteriously vanished, and uncontrollable, horrific monsters roam its abandoned streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate has brought you face to face with the ominous emptiness of a dead city that watches its only visitor with unwavering attention. Face bizarre enemies born from propaganda, science, and madness as you uncover the truth behind the catastrophe, and try to make things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/48641ccdc82da77862524f59293f4a43.avif?t=1787475783\" alt=\"RESTORED, REJUVINATED, REARMED!\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal locations across an alternate history Soviet Union, including collective farms, the Metro, an opera house, city rooftops, secret laboratories, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an arsenal of classic weapons, including the C96 Broomhandle pistol, PPSh submachine gun, Mosin rifle, double barrel shotgun, Molotov cocktails, and experimental retrofuturistic weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive, grotesque enemies inspired by Soviet themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one of Eastern Europe's most unusual cult FPS titles, faithfully revitalized for modern systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/c2bc25805f05fccb16ecd64f846eae6b.avif?t=1787475783\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=400 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/a49dff358692a85bc17e9107faf6cff8.avif?t=1787475783\" alt=\"A forgotten cult classic shooter set in a Soviet totalitarian society.\" width=1200 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.poster.avif?t=1787475783\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.webm?t=1787475783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.mp4?t=1787475783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/d8238c6f15bc9ba60726f17933ca5226.avif?t=1787475783\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate history 1950s Soviet Kyiv, most of the city's population has mysteriously vanished, and uncontrollable, horrific monsters roam its abandoned streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate has brought you face to face with the ominous emptiness of a dead city that watches its only visitor with unwavering attention. Face bizarre enemies born from propaganda, science, and madness as you uncover the truth behind the catastrophe, and try to make things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/48641ccdc82da77862524f59293f4a43.avif?t=1787475783\" alt=\"RESTORED, REJUVINATED, REARMED!\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal locations across an alternate history Soviet Union, including collective farms, the Metro, an opera house, city rooftops, secret laboratories, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an arsenal of classic weapons, including the C96 Broomhandle pistol, PPSh submachine gun, Mosin rifle, double barrel shotgun, Molotov cocktails, and experimental retrofuturistic weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive, grotesque enemies inspired by Soviet themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one of Eastern Europe's most unusual cult FPS titles, faithfully revitalized for modern systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/c2bc25805f05fccb16ecd64f846eae6b.avif?t=1787475783\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=400 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A forgotten cult classic shooter set in an alternate history 1950s Soviet Kyiv, most of the city's population has mysteriously vanished, and horrific monsters roam its abandoned streets. Can you uncover the cause of the catastrophe and set things right?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/47b68109d87a169725e5735d9beb472970003b8e/header.jpg?t=1787475783", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/ec199a0a067d69e90b8a3c5b9eee55ff7a469c8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787475783", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/ec199a0a067d69e90b8a3c5b9eee55ff7a469c8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787475783", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2006 Mandel ArtPlains and Digital Spray Studios. All Rights Reserved. © 2026 Jordan Freeman Group (DBA: ZOOM Platform), BillionTech, and Strategy First. All Rights Reserved.", "developers": ["Digital Spray Studios", "Mandel ArtPlains", "Jordan Freeman Group", "ZOOM Platform Media"], "publishers": ["Strategy First", "BillionTech"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 29, "description": "Steam Trading Cards"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 15, "description": "Stats"}, {"id": 43, "description": "Remote Play on TV"}, {"id": 44, "description": "Remote Play Together"}, {"id": 62, "description": "F